'''Raw Soulflow''' is an {{Uncommon}} item that is related to the Enderman Slayer. When consumed, it grants {{stat|soulflow|1}}, which is used in many abilities for items in the Enderman Slayer, such as [[Final Destination Armor]].

== Obtaining ==
'''Raw Soulflow'''  can be obtained every 180 seconds when the player is on the island and every 185 seconds when the player is offline with the [[Lesser Soulflow Engine]] in any minion equipped, this production is not affected by minion speed but is affected by [[Minion Fuel|minion fuel]] which increase the output for example like the [[Hyper Catalyst]]. This is the unique way of getting it at the moment together with [[Soulflow Engine]] which produces Raw Soulflow every 90 seconds when the player is on the island and 105 seconds when the player is offline.
